  </aside>\n    <div class=\"site-main-content\">\n      \n  \n\n  <article class=\"article-page\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n      <nav class=\"breadcrumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n        <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n        \n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span>\n          <a href=\"/category/news/\">News</a>\n        \n      </nav>\n      \n        <a class=\"kicker\" href=\"/category/news/\">News</a>\n      \n      <h1>Spain’s Ferran Torres Withdraws from Nations League Camp with Ankle Injury</h1>\n      \n        <div class=\"article-dek\">Spain’s forward Ferran Torres left the national team camp on medical advice after a lingering ankle problem, missing the upcoming Nations League games against the Czech Republic and Croatia.</div>\n      \n      <div class=\"byline\">\n        \n          <div class=\"byline-author\">\n            \n            <div>\n              <a class=\"byline-name\" href=\"/author/newsroom-desk/\">Kenya Today Newsroom</a>\n              <time datetime=\"2026-10-04T10:12:16.798803+03:00\">October 4, 2026</time>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n      </div>\n      \n        <nav class=\"share-row\" aria-label=\"Share this story\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A//kenya-today.com/report-spains-ferran-torres-withdraws-from-nations-league-camp-with-ankle-injury-6203/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Share on Facebook\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3c-3 0-5 2-5 5v2H6v4h3v5h4v-5h3l1-4h-4V9c0-.6.4-1 1-1z\"/></svg>\n            <span>Facebook</span>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A//kenya-today.com/report-spains-ferran-torres-withdraws-from-nations-league-camp-with-ankle-injury-6203/&text=Spain%E2%80%99s%20Ferran%20Torres%20Withdraws%20from%20Nations%20League%20Camp%20with%20Ankle%20Injury\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Share